{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-10-19 06:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON DECLARES DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION (NYSE: BK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AUTHORIZED DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK AS FOLLOWS: COMMON – A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.34 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 12, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 1, 2021. PREFERRED – THE FOLLOWING DIVIDENDS FOR THE NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $100,000 PER SHARE, FOR THE DIVIDEND PERIOD ENDING IN DECEMBER 2021, IN EACH CASE PAYABLE ON DECEMBER\xa020, 2021 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER\xa05, 2021: $1,011.11 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $10.111111 PER NORMAL PREFERRED CAPITAL SECURITY OF MELLON CAPITAL IV, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK); $2,250.00 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES D PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $22.500000 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES D PREFERRED STOCK); $895.34 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES E PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $8.953389 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES E PREFERRED STOCK); AND $925.00 PER SHARE ON THE SERIES H PREFERRED STOCK (EQUIVALENT TO $9.250000 PER DEPOSITARY SHARE, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES H PREFERRED STOCK).'}